@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### API e dados de demonstração
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Login do administrador inicial (senha: Admin@123)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@safedrive.com",
  "senha": "Admin@123"
}

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "senha": "Senha@123",
  "perfil": "usuario"
}

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar usuário por ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Administrador Safe Drive",
  "email": "admin@safedrive.com",
  "perfil": "admin"
}

### Excluir usuário por ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
